WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.858 --> 00:00:18.388
Hey Ken! Good to see ya!

00:00:20.518 --> 00:00:21.498
Open the door.

00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:25.767
Heey!

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:27.724
Whoa, hey Mark!
- How's it going?

00:00:28.609 --> 00:00:31.669
You, ah, haven't returned any of my calls.

00:00:32.453 --> 00:00:35.713
Just had a new number when I moved out of town.
- Ah cool! Wanna hang out?

00:00:35.713 --> 00:00:36.493
Aah..

00:00:36.933 --> 00:00:39.113
Well, not now is a good time, Mark.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:40.960
Why not?

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:43.276
There's ... I got, I got some things.

00:00:43.646 --> 00:00:44.836
Some things going on and, ah

00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:46.876
Euhm things, like, things I can help out with?

00:00:46.876 --> 00:00:47.746
No! Ah, this ...

00:00:47.925 --> 00:00:48.965
Please!

00:00:51.219 --> 00:00:53.039
Naw, come on, I'm coming in, allright!

00:00:53.488 --> 00:00:54.438
Could I come in?

00:00:59.311 --> 00:01:01.091
Well, not now is a good time, Mark.

00:01:01.091 --> 00:01:03.051
Oh, yeah! No, no.

00:01:03.425 --> 00:01:05.092
Got some ... some family things going on.

00:01:05.092 --> 00:01:08.702
Right. No, I understand that! Anything I could help out with, maybe?

00:01:09.332 --> 00:01:13.032
No, it's family, family.
- Right, family comes first anytime.

00:01:13.032 --> 00:01:15.062
And we're like, brothers, you and I.

00:01:15.062 --> 00:01:16.462
It's really good to see you, you know.

00:01:16.462 --> 00:01:18.342
Yeah I know, it's good to see you.

00:01:20.492 --> 00:01:22.742
So since, ah, I still have your number

00:01:22.742 --> 00:01:24.692
I'll give you a call and let you know!

00:01:24.692 --> 00:01:28.692
So, see ya later Mark! Okay? Bye.
- Euhm, Ken? Ken, please. Ken, lemme in ...

00:01:33.967 --> 00:01:36.487
Ken, lemme in! Lemme in, Ken!

00:02:03.128 --> 00:02:04.858
Hey Ken!
- Hey Mark.

00:02:09.586 --> 00:02:12.546
Let me in, if that's okay?
- No, I can't.

00:02:12.546 --> 00:02:14.306
I can't, Mark. Can't.

00:02:26.362 --> 00:02:27.522
Hey Ken!

00:02:27.522 --> 00:02:29.102
How you doing?

00:02:29.102 --> 00:02:31.702
Oh, it's good to see you again!

00:02:31.702 --> 00:02:33.612
It's been so long!

00:02:33.612 --> 00:02:34.872
Wait, how did you get in?

00:02:34.872 --> 00:02:36.442
You were just outside!

00:02:36.442 --> 00:02:37.872
I know, now that I'm in here now,

00:02:37.872 --> 00:02:42.112
we're gonna be playing so many fun games together, and having such a great time

00:02:42.112 --> 00:02:46.112
all day every day, playing games, you and me!

00:02:47.511 --> 00:02:49.921
Buddies! You want that, don't cha?

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:54.560
We're gonna have so much fun!

00:03:13.522 --> 00:03:17.522
See? I told ya we'd be playing games together.

00:03:18.486 --> 00:03:19.846
Together forever!

00:03:20.588 --> 00:03:23.258
Best friends forever.

00:03:24.321 --> 00:03:27.701
Stay toasty, my friends.

